		-- W3 step 2 (the Ruins): 3 legs left standing (snapped at 30 / 27 / 24), the NW leg fallen along the front,
		-- the tank and its roof lying on the ground where the leg was (6 parts, top 30, x -10 .. 10, z -8 .. 12)
